Wrong State Transition: Verify state machine prevents skipping states  
POST [http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}/confirm](http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}/confirm)  
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

**Expected Response (400 or 500): (example)**

